@startuml
skinparam maxMessageWidth 130
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign toDirection
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFACD

title 券平台通过选人 SDK 间接调用 UDS

actor "业务调用方\n(发券/展券/查询链路)" as Client
participant "TspCrowdCheckService\n(precuser SDK 接口)" as SdkService
participant "TspCrowdExternal4DataServiceImpl\n(SDK内部: udsQuery)" as SdkImpl
database "Tair\n(模板名配置)" as Tair
participant "UDS平台\nTspUdsApiThriftService.query()\n(com.sankuai.uds.api4poiaggrinfo)" as UDS

Client -> SdkService++: checkCrowdIds(bizCode,\nmpUserInfo, crowdIds)\n(人群圈选查询)
SdkService -> SdkImpl++: udsQuery(userId, ...)
SdkImpl -> Tair++: 读取模板名配置
return templateKey (如 "newUserInformation")
SdkImpl -> SdkImpl: 构造 TspUdsApiParam\nparamMap，如：userId/uuid/phone
SdkImpl -> UDS++: query(tspUdsApiParam)
return TspUdsApiResponse
SdkImpl -> SdkImpl: 解析 response
return 人群命中结果
return CheckCrowdResponse\n(resultMap: crowdId→1/0/-1)
return 业务结果

@enduml